{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"10852","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v1461","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"犬彦","creatorId":"vndb:s1794","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:1748","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1794","name":"犬彦","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:67763","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"ひなたもも","creatorId":"vndb:s716","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:12801","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s716","name":"ひなたもも","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:67764","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"久地マコト","creatorId":"vndb:s1795","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:1366","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1795","name":"久地マコト","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:67765","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"よりは利葉","creatorId":"vndb:s3369","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:14060","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3369","name":"よりは利葉","detail":"ハーレムシナリオ","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:82955","source":"egs"}],"music":[{"creditedName":"Sound Studio B","creatorId":"vndb:s2200","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2200","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2200","name":"Sound Studio B","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:25118","source":"vndb"}],"other":[{"creditedName":"茶太","creatorId":"vndb:s203","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:12879","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s203","name":"茶太","detail":"主題歌 「晴れ→恋心」","roleCode":"vocalist","roleLabel":"歌手","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:83871","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"茶太","creatorId":"vndb:s203","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s203","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s203","name":"茶太","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:25114","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"パリオ","creatorId":"vndb:s2790","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2790","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2790","name":"パリオ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:25119","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c15948","characterName":"秋山 琴子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"33987","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"41515"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18184"],"vndbCharacterId":"c15948"},"originalCharacterName":"秋山 琴子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【天然ボケな幼馴染】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世話焼きでのんびり屋な、明広の幼馴染。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頭のネジがちょっぴり（？）緩く、素直な性格なため、人の話をすぐに信じて、騙されやすい面がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛に関しては奥手だが、周りからの煽りに弱く、また、突然現れた恋のライバルにスイッチが入ったようで、明広に猛烈アタックをかけていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「う、うぅ～…。どうしてこんなことに…」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18184","sourceWorkId":"10852","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"明広の幼馴染。世話焼きでのんびりやであって、頭のネジは緩く忘れっぽい。素直な性格をしているため、人の言うことをすぐに信じ込んでしまい騙されやすい面も持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛に関しては奥手であるのだが、周りからの煽りに弱く派手に攻めることもしばしば。突然の恋のライバル登場によりスイッチが入り、猛烈アピールをかけてゆくことになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「う、うぅ～…。どうしてこんなことに…。」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"33987"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/84/84c86e1f6550c98a193d09cc1744fcefd7876266f5df3e462b41231fd5f8a657.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a7a4f8f7c21afd38497916f5bcdb90f7216e7ae42982fed7838815f9cd1cf52a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田口宏子","creatorId":"vndb:s5","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5","name":"田口 宏子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41515:33987:5020:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c15949","characterName":"Oujou(王女/princess）","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"33988","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"41515"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18185"],"vndbCharacterId":"c15949"},"originalCharacterName":"Oujou(王女/princess）","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She meets the protagonist on the streets where she is detained by people dressed in black, upon which he rescues her. She introduces herself as an alien princess from Andromeda (which results in the protagonist calling her \"Oujou\"/princess) and accompanies the protagonist to his home, where she decides herself that she is going to live there with him."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Apparently she is from a wealthy family, but since she ran away from home, her platinum credit card has been cancelled, she became penniless and has to depend on the protagonist to get by."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She and her family have a strong rivalry with the Ayanokouji family, which is why she strongly reacted upon meeting Kuzuha, declaring herself fiancee of the protagonist."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c15949"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【世間知らずのお姫様】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世間の常識に疎い、箱入り娘お嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大金持ちの家のやり方に反発し家出、連れ戻される所を明広に助けられ一目惚れ、求婚を迫る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのまま、明広宅へ転がり込んで、猪突猛進な猛烈スキスキアピールで攻めかかる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"箱入り娘らしくワガママな面もあるが、明広の言うことには意外と従順。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私の結婚相手は明広だと、私が自分で決めたのだ！」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18185","sourceWorkId":"10852","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大金持ちの家のやり方に反発して飛び出した家出娘。実家に連れ戻されるところを明広に助けられ（？）そのまま明広に求婚をせまり明広の家に転がり込む。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"箱入りで育てられたため世間の常識に疎く、ワガママな一面を持つが明広の言う事には意外と従順である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛に関しては猪突猛進。猛烈な好き好きアピールで明広に攻めかかる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私の結婚相手は明広だと、私が自分で決めたのだ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"33988"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/40/40d0a499c42486ed3173cf96996c54e2e6ffee79ad1afb6c589098fb32a35b78.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/25cf7b3d787e252daf6b9c3ed1320db7b2cce33e10de0d71c45eddf661ad648d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"氷青","creatorId":"vndb:s125","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s125","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s125","name":"海原エレナ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41515:33988:4937:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c15950","characterName":"野々村 香澄","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"33989","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"41515"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18186"],"vndbCharacterId":"c15950"},"originalCharacterName":"野々村 香澄","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【クールな雰囲気の苦労人】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明広の家の前で行き倒れている所を助けられ、そのまま住み着いた少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"超がつくほどのド貧乏で、不幸な生い立ちを持ち、身寄りもない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのためか、表情の変化が乏しく見えるが、自分の感情には素直で、恥ずかしいセリフもさらりと言ってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛経験皆無なため、周りに合わせて真似をしたアプローチを展開。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女の一番の武器はたわわに実った巨乳なのだが、本人は無自覚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「…ボクも明広クンにギュッてして欲しい」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18186","sourceWorkId":"10852","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"超がつくほどのド貧乏であり、不幸な生い立ちを持つ。身寄りもなく、明広の家の前で行き倒れているところを助けてもらい、明広の家に住むこととなる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人と触れ合う機会が少なかったため、見た目では感情の起伏が少ない。自分の感情に素直なため、恥ずかしいセリフもサラリと言う。他人に対するマイナス感情もないため、まずもって怒ったりしない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛経験がないため、好きな人にどう接していいかわからずにいる。なので周りに合わせて真似をしたり、勘違いをしてしまうこともある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無自覚であるが、バツグンのプロモーションが一番の武器。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「…ボクも明広クンにギュッてして欲しい。」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"33989"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dcafdd62b19a7b4947297e512e9468607b0d9f0dd73425388aa0769f97205b8e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/48/48e8da0764d1f30ea456663189fd5066e149ea7b0750f3475db62df237590cd2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"日向裕羅","creatorId":"vndb:s562","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s562","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s562","name":"日向 裕羅","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41515:33989:4673:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c15951","characterName":"綾小路 葛葉","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"33990","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"41515"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18187"],"vndbCharacterId":"c15951"},"originalCharacterName":"綾小路 葛葉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【恋に悩む大和撫子】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男を立たせ3歩下がって着いていくタイプの古風な少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"和風な家で厳しく育てられたため、礼儀正しく真面目で、頭も良い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"けれど、それだと他の3人に出し抜かれてしまうため、結局、力押しのアピールになってしまうことも少なくない様子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本当は、明広とあ～んなことやこ～んなことをしたいと思っているが、家の教えとズレるため、悶々とすることも。実は一番エッチだったりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「皆さん……破廉恥ですわ!!」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18187","sourceWorkId":"10852","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"和風な家で厳しく育てられたので、基本的に大人しく男を立たせて3歩下がるタイプ。頭も良く、根は真面目。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしながら、それだと他の3人に出し抜かれてしまうので力押しをすることも多い。本当は明広とあんなことやこんなことがしたいと思っているのだが、家の教えとズレがあるため悶々としてしまうことも。実は一番エッチ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男主体の古い恋愛感を持つ。好きな男を引き立たせる女でありたいと思うのだが、現実問題として、なかなか思うようにはいかない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「皆さん……破廉恥ですわ!!」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"33990"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/85/8520f6535e535f8acf207ae987eae918abf194cfe310882be6d557379bc802e8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3/d381d2a13ff0ba0314a1b0ba98d1f0b564c1ebcfe3055dc32fa4d61dc9d96ddc.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"友永朱音","creatorId":"vndb:s83","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s83","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s83","name":"友永 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41515:33990:4432:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c120272","characterName":"杉原 明広","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c120272"},"originalCharacterName":"杉原 明広","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c15952","characterName":"南沢 優子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c15952"},"originalCharacterName":"南沢 優子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"de